.TH EAL7 1 "2026-11-03" "FEMoeneye" "oenLytics.x Manual"
.SH NAME
eal7 \- tracking matrix for oenLytics.x own analytics
.SH SYNOPSIS
eal7.html uses oenLytics.js tracking matrix Pages x Events
.SH DESCRIPTION
oenLytics.x is Google Analytics Support Program with own analytics capability.
.br
Tracking matrix: Pages (rows) x Events (columns) = counts.
.br
Endpoints:
.TP
.B /oenlytics.js
JS snippet - calls oenLytics.track()
.TP
.B /track
POST {"page":"eal7.html","event":"page_view"}
.TP
.B /matrix
GET tracking matrix JSON
.TP
.B /stats
GET last 50 events
.SH EXAMPLE
<script src="http://localhost:8082/oenlytics.js"></script>
.br
<script>oenLytics.track('page_view')</script>
